!                                                                                                   
! This test calculates the CC energy with the X2C Hamiltonian                                       
!                                                                                                   
**DIRAC                                                                                             
.TITLE                                                                                              
X2C Hamiltonian, with large speed of light (NR limit). CCSD energies.                               
.WAVE F                                                                                             
.PROPERTIES                                                                                         
**GENERAL                                                                                           
.CVALUE                                                                                             
1.0d8                                                                                               
**PROPERTIES                                                                                        
.DIPOLE                                                                                             
.QUADRUPOLE                                                                                         
.EFG                                                                                                
**INTEGRALS                                                                                         
.NUCMOD                                                                                             
 1                                                                                                  
*READIN                                                                                             
.UNCONTR                                                                                            
**HAMILTONIAN                                                                                       
.X2C                                                                                                
**WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                                    
.SCF                                                                                                
.EXACC                                                                                              
*SCF                                                                                                
.EVCCNV                                                                                             
1.0E-9 1.0E-7                                                                                       
.MAXITR                                                                                             
30                                                                                                  
**EXACC                                                                                             
.OCCUPIED                                                                                           
energy -10000.0 0.0 0.001                                                                           
.VIRTUAL                                                                                            
energy -1.0 1000000000. 0.001                                                                       
.LAMBDA                                                                                             
.PRINT                                                                                              
2                                                                                                   
