*COORDINATES                                                                                        
.UNITS                                                                                              
AU                                                                                                  
*SYMMETRY                                                                                           
.NOSYM                                                                                              
*BASIS                                                                                              
.DEFAULT                                                                                            
cc-pVDZ                                                                                             
*END OF                                                                                             


